{
  "format": "capsule-packs/1",
  "generated": "2026-11-02",
  "law": "Every install runs the Capsule Order: restore point first, manifest disclosed (what / from where), user-initiated, one receipt per app (id, resolved version, source), uninstall mirror for the whole pack. Winget is the primary source (ships with Windows, resolves to upstream vendor installers). Chocolatey is the optional second source; its packages get the same disclose + verify treatment, never silent trust. Exact installer sizes are reported by the source at install time and recorded on the receipt.",
